Adds a sysfs-driven buzzer driver for the PS4 front-panel piezo.
The buzzer shares the indicator ICC channel (major 0x09, minor 0x20)
with the LED subsystem. The EMC distinguishes buzzer from LED by
payload length: LED sends 35 bytes, buzzer sends 1 byte.

Reverse-engineered from Orbis kernel module 12.02.elf
(icc_indicator_set_buzzer function).

Usage:
  echo 1 > /sys/devices/platform/ps4-buzzer/beep

Signed-off-by: Armandas Kvietkus <armandas.kvietkus@proton.me>
---
 drivers/ps4/Makefile     |   1 +
 drivers/ps4/ps4-buzzer.c | 115 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/ps4/ps4-buzzer.h |  24 ++++++++
 3 files changed, 140 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/ps4/ps4-buzzer.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/ps4/ps4-buzzer.h


--------------false
